# Force LF line endings for shell scripts regardless of local git
# core.autocrlf settings (common default on Windows) — a CRLF-terminated
# shebang breaks Docker entrypoints (`exec: no such file or directory`).
# apps/misura-backend/Dockerfile also strips \r at build time as a
# belt-and-braces fix for anyone who already has a CRLF checkout.
*.sh text eol=lf
